Subject: [PATCH 03/11] Ten shaders from Anbernic's DraStic and NNDDSS,
 converted from DraStic's post-FX format

tools/shaders/conv-dfx.py turns a single-pass DraStic .dfx/.dsd into this
project's fragment shader (the vertex stage computed per pixel, DraStic's
u_texture_size/u_target_size/u_time mapped; NNDDSS's fixed screen scale
taken from the frame's size, so the dot grid fits 1x and 2x alike).
Included at the project owner's request (no licence notice in the
originals; THIRD_PARTY.md): DraStic's lcd1x, lcd1x + nds_color, Quilez,
sharp_bilinear (+ nds_color), zfast_lcd (+ nds_color); NNDDSS's
Dot_MiZai, Dot_MiZai-rgds+, retro-tiles-rgds+. 0.9-3.8 ms a screen on the
RG DS's GPU; DraStic's Scanline (24 ms) and the multi-pass ones (FXAA,
SMAA, HQ2X, Scale2X) left out.

